    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ec3bb25b28b7c5cb7c2200f0a265e53c.poster.avif?t=1752004924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ec3bb25b28b7c5cb7c2200f0a265e53c.webm?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ec3bb25b28b7c5cb7c2200f0a265e53c.mp4?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Relax in a sunlit room with soft natural light. Let your troubles drift away as you piece together vibrant puzzles by yourself or with friends in multiplayer!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/8fccfa3c0d6366b7ff964ac40af8cde4.poster.avif?t=1752004924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/8fccfa3c0d6366b7ff964ac40af8cde4.webm?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/8fccfa3c0d6366b7ff964ac40af8cde4.mp4?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Every time a new puzzle is started the pieces are cut from scratch to be a new experience.  No two pieces are alike!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ce87cfd0348a9321074cd22e520e2cea.poster.avif?t=1752004924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ce87cfd0348a9321074cd22e520e2cea.webm?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ce87cfd0348a9321074cd22e520e2cea.mp4?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Randomly generated pieces make it easy to match by shape or colors.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/d2507d701ebe2513af37afc953c272c6.poster.avif?t=1752004924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/d2507d701ebe2513af37afc953c272c6.webm?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/d2507d701ebe2513af37afc953c272c6.mp4?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Create your own difficulty.  Select presets from 100, 200, 600, and 1000 pieces.  Or type in any number you want to test your limits!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Randomly generated pieces<br></li><li>Create puzzles of any size<br></li><li>Beautiful Images and Illustrations chosen specifically for Jigsaw Puzzles<br></li><li>27 High Resolution Puzzles included for Free<br></li><li>Realistic Cozy Environment<br></li><li>Customizable Rooms (wallpaper, floor, table, and more)<br></li><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li><i>Custom Puzzle feature unlocked with purchase of any DLC (Steam Workshop compatible)</i></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ec3bb25b28b7c5cb7c2200f0a265e53c.poster.avif?t=1752004924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ec3bb25b28b7c5cb7c2200f0a265e53c.webm?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ec3bb25b28b7c5cb7c2200f0a265e53c.mp4?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Relax in a sunlit room with soft natural light. Let your troubles drift away as you piece together vibrant puzzles by yourself or with friends in multiplayer!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/8fccfa3c0d6366b7ff964ac40af8cde4.poster.avif?t=1752004924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/8fccfa3c0d6366b7ff964ac40af8cde4.webm?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/8fccfa3c0d6366b7ff964ac40af8cde4.mp4?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Every time a new puzzle is started the pieces are cut from scratch to be a new experience.  No two pieces are alike!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ce87cfd0348a9321074cd22e520e2cea.poster.avif?t=1752004924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ce87cfd0348a9321074cd22e520e2cea.webm?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/ce87cfd0348a9321074cd22e520e2cea.mp4?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Randomly generated pieces make it easy to match by shape or colors.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/d2507d701ebe2513af37afc953c272c6.poster.avif?t=1752004924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/d2507d701ebe2513af37afc953c272c6.webm?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653970/extras/d2507d701ebe2513af37afc953c272c6.mp4?t=1752004924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Create your own difficulty.  Select presets from 100, 200, 600, and 1000 pieces.  Or type in any number you want to test your limits!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Randomly generated pieces<br></li><li>Create puzzles of any size<br></li><li>Beautiful Images and Illustrations chosen specifically for Jigsaw Puzzles<br></li><li>27 High Resolution Puzzles included for Free<br></li><li>Realistic Cozy Environment<br></li><li>Customizable Rooms (wallpaper, floor, table, and more)<br></li><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li><i>Custom Puzzle feature unlocked with purchase of any DLC (Steam Workshop compatible)</i></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Beautiful Multiplayer Jigsaw Puzzle game where you can design the room you play in!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cThis is all just such a great idea, so well executed, and the best digital jigsaw game I\u2019ve played by a long stretch. That you can play a significant amount of it for free is almost silly.\u201d<br>Buried Treasure<br><br>\u201cI retract my call for more jigsaw games because it's possible this is the only one we need\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>",
